  background: single dominant color (~63-69% of cells), center row and center col are all bg except center pixel
  colors: exactly 4 non-bg distinct colors (including center color); all 5 colors distinct
  center_pixel: foreground color at grid center (n,n)
  quadrants: |
    grid divided into 4 diagonal quadrants by center row/col (each n x n cells).
    Each quadrant filled with exactly one non-bg color (scattered randomly).
    No foreground pixels on center row or center col except center pixel.
  quadrant_fill: 33-56% of quadrant cells filled (rest bg) [observed]
